<gpx xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1" creator="open-pilgrimages" version="1.1"><metadata><name>Gudbrandsdalsleden</name><desc>The inland pilgrim way from Oslo to Nidaros Cathedral in Trondheim: 643 km from the ruins of St Mary&apos;s Church in Oslo&apos;s medieval town, over Hadeland, past Gjøvik and Lillehammer, through Gudbrandsdalen and across Dovrefjell, then down through Oppdal and Skaun to the cathedral where St Olav is buried. 24 days here, the high point 1,310 m on Dovrefjell, with about 11,960 m of ascent against 11,880 m of descent.</desc><copyright author="OpenStreetMap contributors"><license>https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/</license></copyright><link href="https://open.pilgrimag.es/st-olav-ways-gudbrandsdalsleden"><text>Gudbrandsdalsleden</text></link></metadata><trk><name>Gudbrandsdalsleden</name><trkseg><trkpt lat="59.903276" lon="10.762856"/><trkpt lat="59.903325" lon="10.763007"/><trkpt lat="59.903343" lon="10.763088"/><trkpt lat="59.903422" lon="10.763395"/><trkpt lat="59.903540" lon="10.763865"/><trkpt lat="59.903576" lon="10.764007"/><trkpt lat="59.903593" lon="10.764076"/><trkpt lat="59.903780" lon="10.764766"/><trkpt lat="59.903866" lon="10.765244"/><trkpt lat="59.903847" lon="10.765145"/><trkpt lat="59.903827" lon="10.765026"/><trkpt lat="59.903796" lon="10.764839"/><trkpt lat="59.903780" lon="10.764766"/><trkpt lat="59.904300" lon="10.766447"/><trkpt lat="59.904277" lon="10.766409"/><trkpt lat="59.904149" lon="10.766198"/><trkpt lat="59.904020" lon="10.765958"/><trkpt lat="59.903978" lon="10.765853"/><trkpt lat="59.903954" lon="10.765776"/><trkpt lat="59.903923" lon="10.765590"/><trkpt lat="59.903866" lon="10.765244"/><trkpt lat="59.904331" lon="10.766452"/><trkpt lat="59.904300" lon="10.766447"/><trkpt lat="59.904387" lon="10.766390"/><trkpt lat="59.904331" lon="10.766452"/><trkpt lat="59.904730" lon="10.766953"/><trkpt lat="59.904657" lon="10.766826"/><trkpt lat="59.904560" lon="10.766677"/><trkpt lat="59.904421" lon="